---
id: pan-fried-ground-turkey
title: Pan-Fried Extra Lean Ground Turkey
category: modular_protein

yield:
  servings: 2
  cooked_g: 330

storage:
  fridge_days: 4
  freezer_friendly: true

equipment:
  - skillet
  - meat-thermometer
---

Heat a large non-stick #skillet over medium-high heat.

Add @extra-lean-ground-turkey{450%g} directly to the dry skillet without added oil. Season evenly with @kosher-salt{0.5%tsp}, @black-pepper{0.5%tsp}, and @garlic-powder{0.5%tsp}.

Break up the meat with a spatula into small crumbles. Sauté for ~cook-time{8%min}, stirring frequently, until the meat is thoroughly browned, moisture has evaporated, and the internal temperature reaches 74°C (165°F) checked with a #meat-thermometer.

Remove from heat and divide the cooked turkey equally into 2 meal prep containers (~165 g cooked per portion).
